637
00:30:29,959 --> 00:30:31,360
[SPEAKER_00]: They'd ever get in battle with Ruth.

638
00:30:34,198 --> 00:30:37,399
[SPEAKER_00]: When he'd fight, he'd cut his own mother to get on base, tie with.

639
00:30:37,419 --> 00:30:39,921
[SPEAKER_00]: He got a hand in two matters.

640
00:30:42,682 --> 00:30:44,423
[SPEAKER_01]: You really never pitched against him, did you?

641
00:30:44,443 --> 00:30:46,083
[SPEAKER_01]: You were always on his side, huh?

642
00:30:46,584 --> 00:30:51,646
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, yeah.

643
00:30:51,706 --> 00:30:52,887
[SPEAKER_00]: I had so many good hitters.

644
00:30:52,987 --> 00:30:57,969
[SPEAKER_00]: Oh, gosh, I'm afraid I could lose them.

