00:30:58,849 --> 00:31:02,191
[SPEAKER_00]: And you, you, Jerry, and the Wainers, and sisters,

646
00:31:03,815 --> 00:31:15,561
[SPEAKER_00]: I don't know if I should just keep my pictures the same way as Alexander, not Madison, but who were before me, Dizzy, Dizzy Dean.

647
00:31:35,767 --> 00:31:40,128
[SPEAKER_00]: I saw him high fastball outside and hit that long fly ball.

648
00:31:40,968 --> 00:31:41,569
[SPEAKER_00]: He could hit it.

649
00:31:41,789 --> 00:31:42,469
[SPEAKER_00]: Yes, he was.

650
00:31:43,049 --> 00:31:43,549
[SPEAKER_00]: Good hitter.

651
00:31:45,750 --> 00:31:47,590
[SPEAKER_01]: Throw many of these brushback pitches?

652
00:31:47,730 --> 00:31:48,470
[SPEAKER_00]: Oh, yeah.

653
00:31:48,971 --> 00:31:49,591
[SPEAKER_00]: We had that.

654
00:31:50,091 --> 00:31:51,451
[SPEAKER_00]: You get orders to do that?

655
00:31:52,051 --> 00:31:52,972
[SPEAKER_00]: What's the signal again?

656
00:31:53,932 --> 00:31:56,393
[SPEAKER_00]: 2, 3, and then 3 and 3.

657
00:31:56,513 --> 00:31:59,093
[SPEAKER_00]: Then our fastball was 2 and 1.

658
00:31:59,173 --> 00:32:00,614
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, different, you know.

659
00:32:00,634 --> 00:32:04,815
[SPEAKER_00]: Then you go on your knees or something like that to be the second sign.

660
00:32:06,150 --> 00:32:07,951
[SPEAKER_00]: They'd go through all that in the spring training.

661
00:32:09,611 --> 00:32:13,292
[SPEAKER_00]: And a lot of times they'd get a man on second base, they'd change, you know.

662
00:32:15,193 --> 00:32:17,594
[SPEAKER_00]: Of course, the shortstop would be relaying it.

663
00:32:18,714 --> 00:32:25,397
[SPEAKER_00]: He gets back up here with his hand, open or packed, and then the center fielder gets an idea of what's thrown too.

664
00:32:26,857 --> 00:32:34,720
[SPEAKER_00]: Now, whether they do all that now or not, but they used to relay some fun signs of the shortstop, shortstop relay, the second baseman relays it on.

665
00:32:36,018 --> 00:32:38,340
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, you get a different break on the ball, too, if you like.

