00:32:50,830 --> 00:32:51,231
[SPEAKER_01]: Oh, yeah.

669
00:32:51,511 --> 00:32:52,051
[SPEAKER_01]: Or did you just?

670
00:32:52,412 --> 00:33:00,098
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, I remember one time he had a pitch against the athletics in Detroit.

