00:33:03,020 --> 00:33:04,762
[SPEAKER_00]: Tom was playing in the center field.

673
00:33:06,672 --> 00:33:10,614
[SPEAKER_00]: And I forget who was coaching on third base.

674
00:33:12,274 --> 00:33:16,276
