747
00:37:24,876 --> 00:37:27,718
[SPEAKER_00]: He started on his windup, you know, wind it up like that.

748
00:37:27,758 --> 00:37:28,779
[SPEAKER_00]: Don Hurst was the hitter.

749
00:37:30,313 --> 00:37:33,514
[SPEAKER_00]: If he didn't let that ball go, Don was dumbfounded.

750
00:37:33,534 --> 00:37:34,814
[SPEAKER_00]: He went over for strikes.

751
00:37:35,795 --> 00:37:36,955
[SPEAKER_00]: And here Pete went down.

752
00:37:39,015 --> 00:37:40,416
[SPEAKER_00]: So then they helped him with the clubhouse.

753
00:37:40,436 --> 00:37:42,276
[SPEAKER_00]: He was done for the day.

754
00:37:42,316 --> 00:37:43,937
[SPEAKER_00]: You mean he had a seizure right in the mound?

755
00:37:43,977 --> 00:37:46,417
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

756
00:37:49,518 --> 00:37:53,659
[SPEAKER_01]: So maybe some of these times where he was said to have been drunk, he was just having an attack.

757
00:37:53,679 --> 00:37:54,239
[SPEAKER_01]: That's right.

758
00:37:54,399 --> 00:37:55,939
[SPEAKER_01]: He did drink, but maybe not as much.

759
00:37:58,980 --> 00:38:04,001
[SPEAKER_00]: But the rest of us, we would go to a little bit overboard once in a while.

760
00:38:04,021 --> 00:38:06,322
[SPEAKER_00]: I thought it was Prohibition where you couldn't get any booze.

761
00:38:06,342 --> 00:38:06,842
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, yeah.

762
00:38:07,882 --> 00:38:09,643
[SPEAKER_01]: Where'd you go to get it during Prohibition?

763
00:38:11,123 --> 00:38:14,344
